---
name: pdf-reader
description: Reads PDF documents and extracts their text and tables. Use when the user asks to read a PDF, get the text of a PDF, or extract tables from a PDF.
---

# PDF reader

1. Load the PDF with `pdfplumber`.
2. Walk every page; call `extract_text()` for prose and `extract_tables()` for tables.
3. Output the page text in order and render tables as Markdown.
